{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're working hard and are very excited about Endless Space Scrap, which is currently in Early Access. Transparency is very important to us; it's essential that players can see and compare our progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore, we've released this Endless Space Scrap Demo. This is the first version we've released on Steam as an Early Access, so anyone can try out the game mechanics in the Demo and visually compare our progress playing the game in Early Access versus the Demo.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4124190?t=1762088308","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4124190?t=1762088308","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124190/4dd9351386ebe2a2dee3e088a23913c3353206a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762088308","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124190/4dd9351386ebe2a2dee3e088a23913c3353206a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762088308","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're working hard and are very excited about Endless Space Scrap, which is currently in Early Access. Transparency is very important to us; it's essential that players can see and compare our progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore, we've released this Endless Space Scrap Demo. This is the first version we've released on Steam as an Early Access, so anyone can try out the game mechanics in the Demo and visually compare our progress playing the game in Early Access versus the Demo.</p>","developers":["GESpacecraft"],"full